  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Among the five regions the west is a huge desert where greenery is extremely rare and yellow sand fills the view.",
      "chapters": [
        334
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blood food for Gu that need fresh blood is scarce here relative to the Southern Border’s forests.",
      "chapters": [
        157
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "One of Western Desert’s seven most famous natural wonders is the movement of hundreds of thousands of sand dunes along a fixed curved path. On that path there are no oases, beasts, or rocks, only yellow sand, and even rank eight Gu Immortals cannot stop it. Western Desert’s people call them impassable dunes. The impassable dunes are where Fang Yuan first does open business in the region.",
      "chapters": [
        837
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "impassable-dunes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_impassable_dunes",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Western Desert is named the place with the greatest trade economy in the five regions.",
      "chapters": [
        996
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "trade-and-xiao-clan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Xiao clan ranks among the richest Western Desert super forces because it holds the Immortal Gu House Ten Thousand Li Silk Corridor, which spreads like a spider web to move goods and burns through large numbers of mortal spider Gu to stay in use. Fang Yuan opens a long-term regretful spider trade with that clan at the dunes and later holds a crucial transaction token after gaining their recognition.",
      "chapters": [
        837
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "trade-and-xiao-clan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_xiao_clan_western_desert",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_ten_thousand_li_silk_corridor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Western Desert names a dozen or so super forces, with Tang clan among them.",
      "chapters": [
        776
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "super-forces",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_tang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Western Desert and Eastern Sea have the other regions between them, so a Western Desert Gu Immortal reaching Eastern Sea is rare enough to be eye-catching.",
      "chapters": [
        819
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "distance-from-the-eastern-sea",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Other Western Desert groups include a featherman clan living for generations in a fragment world of green heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        870
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "a-featherman-clan-in-a-fragment-world",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Western Desert’s membrane is named the raging flame regional wall.",
      "chapters": [
        1043
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "regional-wall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
